     3835       .
     3836       for each buf_usr-flt_custom-labels where
     3837              buf_usr-flt_custom-labels.call-type = 'add-fields':U
     3838          and buf_usr-flt_custom-labels.call-point = 'barcodfi':U
     3839          and buf_usr-flt_custom-labels.tbl-name = 'bar-code':U
